WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.501
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.970
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.337
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.337 --> 00:00:07.473
When asked why he thinks
he's trailing behind

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:10.176
former President Trump
in some recent surveys,

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:12.478
President Biden told reporters
last week that he's beating

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:16.248
Trump in eight out of ten polls.
Though, for what it's worth,

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:22.122
they're both still trailing far
behind literally anyone else.

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:23.589
President Biden on Thursday

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:26.926
met with members of the
United Auto Workers in Illinois

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.095
and wore a red
UAW T-shirt.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:31.731
Yes, the outfit
of the common man.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:37.737
A T-shirt over a button down.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:39.572
He looks like he ran out
of clean laundry

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.742
and had to wear
everything inside out.

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.544
South Carolina
Senator Tim Scott

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.946
announced that he has suspended
his presidential campaign

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:48.981
in a Fox News
interview yesterday,

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:50.950
and said he thinks the voters
are telling him, quote,

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.118
"Not now, Tim."

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:53.419
And I think
he made the right call

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:57.957
because half of them said,
"Not now, Jim."

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.959
That's right.
Tim Scott yesterday suspended

00:00:59.959 --> 00:01:02.095
his presidential campaign,
though something tells me

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.097
we haven't seen
the last of Tim Scott.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.098
Okay, now we have.

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.334
That's probably the end of it.

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:10.002
The Biden administration
announced on Friday

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.504
that the Department
of Veterans Affairs

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.607
will expand health benefits,
including a no cost option

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.076
for those who served
in World War II.

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:21.915
Oh. Very generous.
What else are you offering?

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:26.586
Free insulin
for Civil War veterans?

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.287
Former President Trump
reportedly held

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.089
an off-the-record dinner
for reporters

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:31.357
last night at Mar a Lago,

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.959
and served Mr. President's
wedge salad.

00:01:33.959 --> 00:01:37.563
Trump has a signature salad?
What?

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:42.302
What is it,
ranch dressing on a Big Mac?

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:45.704
The so-called QAnon Shaman
filed paperwork last week

00:01:45.704 --> 00:01:49.776
to run for Congress in Arizona
as a moderate Republican.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:52.145
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:53.446
A state lawmaker in Florida

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:55.515
recently introduced a new bill
that would create

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.416
a Margaritaville-themed
license plate.

00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:02.688
Well, that ought to save time
with the breathalyzer.

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.457
According to a new report,
the average rent

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.258
in New York City
decreased last month,

00:02:06.258 --> 00:02:09.696
but only because everyone
added another roommate.

00:02:15.234 --> 00:02:17.269
After a deer in new Jersey

00:02:17.269 --> 00:02:19.806
recently dented the side
of a Chevy Silverado

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.341
right before its owner
was set to sell the car,

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:25.211
the man reduced
the car's price by $1,000

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:26.512
while the deer's family

00:02:26.512 --> 00:02:28.580
was reduced by a buck.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.617
[ Laughter and groaning ]

00:02:36.923 --> 00:02:41.560
I'll apologize
for the rent joke two back,

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.498
but I'll [bleep] die
on this hill.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:49.936
Everything about that joke
is perfect.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.704
If you want to sit there
and groan

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.406
because you didn't think
of that joke, that's fine.

00:02:54.406 --> 00:02:56.809
But that's the only
reason to be upset.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.815
A man in Australia
recently survived

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:04.684
a crocodile attack
by biting it,

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.485
causing the animal
to let him go.

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:07.820
And if I know Australians,

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:11.290
it was the third thing
he mentioned when he got home.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:13.126
[Australian accent] "Yeah,
boss was a real jerk today.

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.960
Oh, I saw Kendra.
She changed her hair.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.063
Oh, and I bit a croc."

00:03:20.399 --> 00:03:22.234
[Normally] Been getting a lot
of complaints recently

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:26.406
about how good
my Australian accent is,

00:03:26.406 --> 00:03:29.542
but I think we pretty safely
put those to bed.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:36.849
And finally,
according to --

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.050
Oh, wait a second, I --

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.053
Buck also means dear.

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:52.999
I apologize -- I'm so --

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:57.670
[Bleep] grow up.

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:06.145
And finally, according to new
analysis by an adult website,

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:08.481
the most searched sex position
in the country

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:10.115
is the pretzel,
followed closely

00:04:10.115 --> 00:04:12.384
by "chiropractor near me."

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:13.553
And that was a monologue.

